The MIT license above covers the original Rust port code authored for this
repository.

Super Mario Bros. is a trademark and copyright of Nintendo. This project is a
static recompilation derived from a community disassembly of the game. It
contains NO Nintendo ROM data — you must supply your own legally-obtained ROM
to run it.

Acknowledgements:
  - The original 6502 disassembly (docs/smbdis.asm) was written by doppelganger
    (doppelheathen@gmail.com).
  - The original C++ "SuperMarioBros-C" project, from which this Rust port was
    derived, was created by Mitchell Sternke.
